    apply: "Write down, privately, three worries and bring them to God in prayer each day this week using 1 Peter 5:7. Identify one trusted person you could talk to. Memorise 1 Peter 5:7. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
    activity: "Read Isaiah 41:10 and 1 Peter 5:6-7 aloud. Invite learners to name general sources of fear on a board without personal details. Pray together, casting those burdens on God.",
