    apply: "Notice your own patterns of worry or low mood this week, noting sleep, appetite and energy without judging yourself. Speak a kind, truthful word to someone who seems burdened. Memorise Proverbs 12:25. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
    activity: "Read 1 Kings 19:1-8 and Proverbs 12:25. List what God did for Elijah and what a friend could do today. Practise offering a good word in pairs.",
