    activity: "Read Philippians 4:4-9. Practise a three-part prayer in pairs: name the worry, thank God, ask for his peace. Share how it felt and pray for one another.",
    takeHome: "Read Philippians 4, Psalm 55 and Psalm 94. Keep a worry and thanks journal for a week. Memorise Philippians 4:6-7.",
