    sa: ["Summarise the main truths of the first half of the course.", ["god cares", "prayer", "lament", "jesus", "whole person", "community"], "A good answer says God cares and is present, we bring fears to him in prayer with thanksgiving and lament, Jesus understands distress, we care for body and mind, seek help and need community."],
